    "name": "Collapsed Galaxy 2",
    "steam_appid": 2390660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsed Galaxy 2 is a tribute from the team and community to a game loved 21 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this interstellar contest, where alliances and betrayals are rife, only the most astute commanders will emerge victorious in the solar system's struggle for dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or create a legion, aim to lead, and your decisions will crucially affect the tense political and military situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a legion commander, you have the chance to ascend to the height of imperial power by winning a factional election, becoming the Imperial Regent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Regent can assign legion leaders to key posts, such as Minister of Intelligence, Minister of Foreign Affairs, Minister of Defense, and Commander of the Imperial Guard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience up to 50-player real-time strategic battles, with dynamic territorial control by factions, where managing intelligence and supply lines is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and equip over 2500 combat components freely according to your tech path and level, to adapt to the evolving frontline battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collapsed Galaxy 1 Originated from Chinese Community Co-Creation Ten Years Ago</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on contributions, support, and encouragement from the Chinese player community. Visit our website to view this valuable list.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsed Galaxy 2 is a tribute from the team and community to a game loved 21 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/8feb790a098bf3a21d6a79b9b423ea5a.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this interstellar contest, where alliances and betrayals are rife, only the most astute commanders will emerge victorious in the solar system's struggle for dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or create a legion, aim to lead, and your decisions will crucially affect the tense political and military situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a legion commander, you have the chance to ascend to the height of imperial power by winning a factional election, becoming the Imperial Regent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Regent can assign legion leaders to key posts, such as Minister of Intelligence, Minister of Foreign Affairs, Minister of Defense, and Commander of the Imperial Guard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience up to 50-player real-time strategic battles, with dynamic territorial control by factions, where managing intelligence and supply lines is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and equip over 2500 combat components freely according to your tech path and level, to adapt to the evolving frontline battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collapsed Galaxy 1 Originated from Chinese Community Co-Creation Ten Years Ago</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on contributions, support, and encouragement from the Chinese player community. Visit our website to view this valuable list.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/45640274728a0e105535d8237fa21cfa.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.poster.avif?t=1743039308\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.webm?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390660/extras/e5fa92707c1695cee92a5d417683702e.mp4?t=1743039308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Human factions face increasingly severe conflicts, with the 'Planetary Defense Council' secretly seeking political power in space and colonies. Discover a breakthrough to maintain dominance between starport and crisis-ridden colonial planets. A 4C-RTS Game: Collaborate, Control, Conspire, Conquer.",
